      "4f9c78da-a060-457b-85d5-578b2ce9c084"],
     ", those all of whose neighbours lie in the cone"
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"583e7789-a401-4d3c-8027-2495ddb9c430"]}
  }]], "2ColumnTableMod",ExpressionUUID->"5dac44fe-31e0-4dac-889f-\
8a635484b645"],

Cell["\<\
The apex is boundary, and so is the axis near it, where the cone is thinner \
than one step.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"04ffa3b3-ed84-4bf9-af3a-1d35a7df0f27"],

